              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Sage Self Oral Care</span></span></span></h1>\n<h2>Toothbrush with Corinz Antiseptic Cleansing and Moisturizing Oral Rinse</h2>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Help address the risk factors associated with the #1 hospital-acquired infection, pneumonia.¹ The convenient, all-in-one system can remain at the bedside and doesn't require nurse assistance to use.</span></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 31 2024 17:46:33 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
