          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Understand the importance of oral care</span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Improving patient oral hygiene is something you can do easily — and it can significantly impact the risk factors for pneumonia.&nbsp;</span></p>\n",
